{"id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-diagonal-halting.md","title":"Diagonal Halting Language","display":"df-diagonal-halting-language — Diagonal Halting Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting","aliases":["73-df-binary-diagonal-halting","73-df-diagonal-halting-language"],"display":"df-diagonal-halting-language — Diagonal Halting Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-diagonal-halting</span><span>73-df-diagonal-halting-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-halting-language — Diagonal Halting Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (binary alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed coding package, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span> (canonically described binary-input DTM)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}},\\to_M^*,\\operatorname{Halting}_M\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}},\\to_M^*,\\operatorname{Halting}_M\\)</span> (machine semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halts}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Halts}_M\\)</span> 只在机器的二进制输入域调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}halting\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\land\n\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}halting\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\land\n\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*C\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}halting\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}halting\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the diagonal halting language. It is distinct from the paired machine-input halting language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","status":"resolved","id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\